+- 2026-10-25 (4): smart animals: path-walked wandering, a herd's pull and running from a blow (NOT b1.7.3; written WITHOUT a Rust toolchain: not compiled, not run; +3 tests `mobs::tests::{a_smart_pig_never_walks_off_a_cliff, a_hit_animal_runs_from_the_blow, a_stray_animal_drifts_back_to_its_herd}`, +1 assert in `options::options_txt_round_trips`; run `cargo test --lib mobs options` first). Pig, cow, sheep and chicken only; the wolf, squid and every monster keep the b1.7.3 AI untouched.
